                    image or other artifact built from any of it.

"the Licensor"    — the copyright holder named above.

"You"             — any natural person or legal entity that accesses, copies,
                    stores, compiles, executes or otherwise uses the Work.

"Written Permission" — a signed or e-mailed grant issued by the Licensor to a
                    named recipient, for a stated purpose, and dated. Nothing
                    else counts: not a public repository, not an issue comment,
                    not silence, not prior conduct.


